    "body": "In the \"invalid output witnessScript typed key\" case, the value no longer hashes to the redeemScript's P2WSH program: 65f0b3dd trimmed it to its last six bytes while fixing a short read. This restores the original 37-byte script as the value and keeps the key one byte too long — the only defect, same layout the redeemScript case already uses, same total length.\n\n*Made with my usual tools: a computer, the Internet and an LLM. The mistakes, as usual, are all mine.*\n\n",
