      "body": "Tend to NACK\r\n\r\nThe pr description is needlessly verbose and confusing. I've re-read it 5 times and do not understand what the actual problem is. What do curve points have to do with witness scripts? The `keydata` for a `PSBT_OUT_WITNESS_SCRIPT` does not contain any interpretable data, and the point of the test is to make sure that parsers are checking the length and not interpreting any data.",
