      "message": "BIP-174: test data: make the witnessScript in the invalid-key case match its P2WSH hash\n\nIn the \"PSBT with invalid output witnessScript typed key\" case, the\nvalue of the PSBT_OUT_WITNESS_SCRIPT record no longer hashes to the\nP2WSH program in the output's redeemScript: 65f0b3dd trimmed it to its\nlast six bytes while fixing a short read.\n\nRe-encode the record as `02 0100 25 <script>`: the key stays one byte\ntoo long, which is what the case tests, and the value is the original\n37-byte script again. Same total length, same layout as the \"invalid\noutput redeemScript typed key\" case.",
